===Etymology===
* From {{bor|en|oj|wiinibig||dirty waters}}, from {{m|oj|wiini'|wiini’|to make someone dirty}}, {{m|oj|wiinad||it is dirty}}, + {{m|oj|nibi||water}}, plural {{m|oj|nibi|nibig|waters}}.
* After the lake, from {{der|en|cr|-}}/{{bor|en|csw|ᐑᓂᐯᐠ||muddy waters}}, describing the river's water entering the lake ([[CanOD]]).

